<BaseLayout
  title="About Indian Keto — Our Mission & Team"
  description="Learn about Indian Keto — our mission to make keto Indian food accessible, delicious, and practical for everyone."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-6">About Indian Keto</h1>
      <div class="prose-keto">
        <p>Indian Keto was founded in 2026 with a simple mission: to help people enjoy the rich, vibrant flavors of Indian cuisine while following a ketogenic diet.</p>
        <p>We believe that going keto shouldn't mean giving up the foods you love. Indian cuisine is naturally rich in spices, healthy fats, and proteins — making it one of the best cuisines in the world to adapt for a low-carb lifestyle.</p>
        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <p>We create in-depth guides, tested recipes, and curated product recommendations specifically for the Indian keto community. Every recipe we share has been tested to ensure it delivers authentic Indian flavor while keeping net carbs low.</p>
        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Authentic flavors first</strong> — We never compromise on taste. Every recipe uses traditional Indian spices and techniques.</li>
          <li><strong>Practical and accessible</strong> — Our recipes use ingredients you can find at regular grocery stores and Indian markets.</li>
          <li><strong>Evidence-based</strong> — All nutritional information is calculated and verified. We don't make claims we can't back up.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Have a question or suggestion? We'd love to hear from you. Reach out at <a href="mailto:hello@indianketo.com">hello@indianketo.com</a> or visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
